[WORK]
UID: WORK-SCRIBE-MOVE-ROUNDTRIP-CONTRACT
TITLE: Put the move round-trip refusal under a contract
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Since 07518382 both the dry and the real move path render and reparse the
source document before the rename, so a document that does not round-trip is
refused. The behaviour is documented in the sdoc skill, docs/sdoc/README.md
and WORK-SCRIBE-DRY-RUN, and no test exercises it. Add a contract with a
positive control: a document made non-round-trippable is refused by both paths
with the same message, and a clean one moves.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
Found by the dry-run re-review on 2026-09-04.
<<<
